{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12301240","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12301240","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1230124001:1":{"text":"오, 물론 러스트 항에는 블러디 로즈가 있죠.","source_cn":"哦，当然，锈锚港有血薇帮。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6688769CB1582CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1230124002:1":{"text":"하지만 지금은 상황이 좋지 않아요. 하루 종일 사방을 돌아다니면서 물귀신파를 잡고 다니니 다들 겁에 질렸어요.","source_cn":"不过他们也算不上多好，整天挨家挨户地抓水鬼帮的人，大家...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x220CE573B9F4241B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1230124003:1":{"text":"그들끼리의 싸움은 그렇다 쳐도... 장사를 방해하는 건 참을 수 없어요!","source_cn":"帮派斗争我们也就忍了，可打扰人做生意，这就忍不了了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE63E58EC1A60B0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1230124004:1":{"text":"그냥... 저는 이 상황을 바꿀 수 없지만, 어쩌면 가능한 사람이 있을지도 모르죠.","source_cn":"不过，我也就说说……真要让我做什么改变现状，我也做不出...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x995546B48165642E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:商人歌瑞尔":{"text":"상인 게인렐","source":"商人歌瑞尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}